{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-strand-twist-datum","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:strand-twist-datum","kind":"definition","title":"Per-strand framing (twist) datum","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-gauge-action-groupoid","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-coulomb-charge"],"cites":["references/habiro2000","references/bilson-thompson2005","references/bilsonthompson2007","references/baez-huerta2010"],"tags":["appendix","standard-model","framing","ribbon","hypercharge"],"defines":["strand-twist-datum"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum","text":"strand-twist-datum.md","leanSource":"strand-twist-datum.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:strand-twist-datum\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code> be an <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code>-strand state of the gauge-action groupoid. A <dfn class=\"defterm\" id=\"term-strand-twist-datum\">per-strand framing datum</dfn> on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code> is a function</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  t \\colon \\{1, \\dots, n\\} \\longrightarrow \\mathbb{Z},</code></pre>\n<p>assigning to each strand an integer ribbon twist, together with the total twist <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T(t) = \\sum_i t_i</code>. The pair <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\beta, t)</code> is a framed state. The datum is an independent label on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\beta</code>, not the twist the ambient ribbon structure already carries.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.md","heading":"Definition","number":"27.3.1","page":"b/def-strand-twist-datum","qa":{"counts":{"pass":61,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":16,"unknown":0,"stale":76}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.StandardModel.TwistDatum","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/strand-twist-datum.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
